# Template for /etc/job-agent/approval.env on the Beelink (root:root, chmod 0600). Loaded ONLY by
# apply-submit.service. The same random value (32+ characters) is set as APPROVAL_SIGNING_KEY in
# Vercel's server environment, where the contact-manager signs each approval; apply-submit refuses
# any approval it cannot verify with it. Pasted in by hand, never by a script, never into git.
APPROVAL_SIGNING_KEY=
